# MallPlus Project Rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` before making any changes.
- Keep `MEMORY.md` aligned with the current phase and blockers.
- Follow the project brief and tech design in `agent_docs/`.
- Preserve Spring Boot 3 / Spring Cloud Alibaba and the original RabbitMQ order-delay flow.
- Keep business logic in service/impl layers.
- Centralize cache keys and RocketMQ topic/tag constants.
- Prefer one bounded feature at a time and verify after it.
- Do not add tables, delete files, or add out-of-scope features without approval.
